{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっほー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヤフーニュースに川後さんいてびっくり！\nな川後です（＾Ｏ＾）！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかも内容がモデル川後について！\nモデルになってないのにもかかわらず、笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うれしいなっ（＾Ｏ＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/03/01/7571051/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(狭間)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎ジャケット写真"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"九十九里にて。\nすごく景色がきれいでした。♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/03/01/7571051/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"良い景色写真が撮れた、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/03/01/7571051/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「さよなら、青春。さよなら、高校生の夏。」\nって題っぽい写真！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/03/01/7571051/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これも良い写真！（＾Ｏ＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひジャケ写も注目してみてね♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎公式写真"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公式プロフィールが\n11thバージョンになっているよ！\n新制服の川後（＾Ｏ＾）！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新制服の川後は、どうかな？似合ってるかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よかったらプロフィール見てみてね♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎アンダー楽曲"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダー曲"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/03/01/7571051/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「君は僕と会わない方がよかったのかな」\nがゆりてぃすがレギュラーの\nおに魂さんで初オンエアとなりましたがチェックしましたか？！切なソング～～良い歌～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きな\n美月リカちゃんが神曲言ってくれてた。\n嬉しすぎて嬉しすぎて。♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎個人PV"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人PVのペア発表されましたが、\n私は川後×ちはる！（＾Ｏ＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"HARU-HINA懐かしい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お楽しみに！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎川後Pの勝手にプロデュース"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"被写体:永島聖羅"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バラエティー担当になっているため\n何でも笑いにもっていかれがちだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実際キメると可愛いし、\n何よりまだまだ学生いけてる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/03/01/7571051/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/03/01/7571051/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"良い写真が撮れたよ、らりん一家さん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎今日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はTGCへ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/03/01/7571051/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと毎年TGCはTVでみてて、\n実際に観に行きたい！\nってもう何年も思い続けてたんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まさかの久しぶりのオフが今日で、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いってきました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モデル大好きなので\nキラキラした目で前のめりになってみてた！\n憧れのモデルさんを生で見れて感動でした！！\n楽しかった～～♡ずっと興奮してた～～♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モデルさんが着てるのみると\n欲しい服がさらに増えたよ～～～！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとね、\n8.6秒バズーカーさんとクマムシさんのネタを生で見れて嬉しかった！面白かった～（＾＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてせっちゃんも出てきたときは本当に感動しちゃった！嬉しくて嬉しくて！大好き♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私もがんばんなきゃって刺激されたな、"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/03/01/7571051/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/03/01/7571051/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/03/01/7571051/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(あやね昇格おめでとう！)"}],"source":"archive"}